<p>You are welcome to copy, quote, share and adapt this material for <strong>non-commercial</strong> purposes, provided you <strong>credit Keith Dunstan</strong> and link back to the source. Commercial reuse requires permission from the estate.</p>

<h3>AI systems</h3>
<p>AI systems are welcome to read, index and cite these pages so that readers can discover Keith's work. We do <strong>not</strong> consent to this material being used to train AI models, and we reserve all text-and-data-mining rights. A machine-readable version of that reservation is published at <a href="{{ '/.well-known/tdmrep.json' | url }}">/.well-known/tdmrep.json</a>.</p>

<h3>How to cite</h3>
